Z||000018||rogergarrison||12-30-2001||01:08 AM||||hes rite about switching to auto from a stick. That what I wanted to do. It takes the complete dash wiring harness from an auto for just starters. My estimate for a new crate auto installed was over $5,000. If you want an auto, do what I did and just search for an auto car to start with.||||reg||1
